# Read at build time — changing any of these needs a redeploy, not just a restart.

# ── Mainnet ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_XENIA_NETWORK=mainnet
NEXT_PUBLIC_XENIA_ESCROW=0x2d329a8c65adccb51b17ef5274e7234c998dc29c02dc2c7a3c6d064af341cbe

# ── Sepolia ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEXT_PUBLIC_XENIA_NETWORK=sepolia
# NEXT_PUBLIC_XENIA_ESCROW=0x7d01c97a95ddc117ac63be7a6ab4b042d87d8a70c1cadbdb1f4c1f88b68094e

# ── Relaying (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lets a recipient be paid without gas, a signature, or a wallet — just an address. The relayer
# can only ever pay the address the link's signature names, so its exposure is the gas it holds.
# Server-side only: no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix, so these never reach the browser.
# XENIA_RELAYER_ADDRESS=
# XENIA_RELAYER_PRIVATE_KEY=
# XENIA_RPC_URL=https://api.zan.top/public/starknet-mainnet

# ── Private claim (SDK route) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Not in any StarkWare doc — read out of starkware-industries/pripay server.js:19-26 and verified
# live 2026-08-26 (405 on GET, valid JSON-RPC error on a malformed POST). See
# contracts/ONCHAIN-FINDINGS.md and ~/Projects/Inertia/projects/velum/docs/SPIKE.md, which proved
# these against a real mainnet transaction first. Browser-exposed (NEXT_PUBLIC_): the recipient's
# own wallet is the signer here, not a server key, so there is nothing secret in these URLs.
NEXT_PUBLIC_XENIA_PROVING_SERVICE_URL=https://transaction-prover.alpha-mainnet.sw-dev.io
NEXT_PUBLIC_XENIA_DISCOVERY_URL=https://discovery-service.alpha-mainnet.sw-dev.io
NEXT_PUBLIC_XENIA_NODE_URL=https://rpc.starknet.lava.build

# Sepolia siblings, for rehearsal:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_XENIA_PROVING_SERVICE_URL=https://transaction-prover.alpha-sepolia.sw-dev.io
# NEXT_PUBLIC_XENIA_DISCOVERY_URL=https://discovery-service.alpha-sepolia.sw-dev.io
# NEXT_PUBLIC_XENIA_NODE_URL=https://rpc.starknet-testnet.lava.build

# Script-only (scripts/probe-register-claim.ts). Never NEXT_PUBLIC_ — this is a private key.
# A throwaway Sepolia account with a few test STRK, nothing more. See docs/PRIVATE-CLAIM-PROBE.md.
# XENIA_PROBE_SENDER_PRIVATE_KEY=
# XENIA_PROBE_SENDER_ADDRESS=
# XENIA_PROBE_CLAIMANT_PRIVATE_KEY=
# XENIA_PROBE_CLAIMANT_ADDRESS=
